    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Promote the SHA-pinning convention across .github/workflows/** and .github/actions/** into a merge-blocking and commit-blocking contract. Adds tools/lint/workflow-pins.sh (line-oriented lint with five classification rules and fail-closed dynamic-ref handling), test fixtures that act as the lint's own spec, and a regression test runner. The lint runs as a step in ci-supply-chain.yml AND as a pre-commit hook gate in .githooks/pre-commit — same script, two consumers. No allow-list for un-pinned refs; the correct resolution for any flagged ref is to pin it.\n",
